      "id": 487986,
      "username": "chrisidakwo",
      "name": "Chris Idakwo",
      "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:21:28.170Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the suggestions.</p>\n<p>My understanding of fixtures is that it’s for seeding data whenever the app is installed. Not sure how I can use it to achieve what I need. Also, I’m not clear on how to use property setters in code.</p>\n<p>In the meantime, I’ve gone with using the <code>vehicle.js</code> file to arrange the fields as I want them to appear.</p>",
